stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Validating : user submits request
    Validating --> Rejected_input : invalid interval / capacity / hours / notice
    Validating --> Locked : SELECT ... FOR UPDATE on resource row
    Locked --> Conflict : overlapping PENDING/APPROVED booking or blackout
    Locked --> Unavailable : resource MAINTENANCE / RETIRED
    Locked --> PENDING : category requires approval
    Locked --> APPROVED : no approval needed or requester is approver
    PENDING --> APPROVED : coordinator/admin approves
    PENDING --> REJECTED : coordinator/admin rejects (reason required)
    PENDING --> REJECTED : expiry job (start time passed)
    PENDING --> CANCELLED : requester or approver cancels
    APPROVED --> CANCELLED : cancelled before end time
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    APPROVED --> [*] : time slot elapses
    Rejected_input --> [*]
    Conflict --> [*]
    Unavailable --> [*]
